#: btw:rsusage
msgid ""
"Usage:\n"
"  btw [--lang <code>] list               List modules\n"
"  btw [--lang <code>] help <module>      Show a module's options\n"
"  btw [--lang <code>] <module> [options] Run a module\n"
"  btw --version"
msgstr ""
"Uso:\n"
"  btw [--lang <code>] list               Listar módulos\n"
"  btw [--lang <code>] help <module>      Mostrar las opciones de un módulo\n"
"  btw [--lang <code>] <module> [options] Ejecutar un módulo\n"
"  btw --version"

